{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">元朗YOHO發生疑似狗咬狗事件。網上流傳一段貼文，有網民上載數段影片及圖片，留言：「有一隻大狗突然咬住隻細狗死都唔放口！隻細狗好似已經活生生被咬死咗……細狗主人喺後面眼睜睜睇住，當場喊到崩潰，成個人震晒，睇到人到心碎埋🥺」</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-17 下午6.20.35.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20268kkG9AS1HT1786962355.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-17 下午6.20.35.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">相中所見，有一隻棕色大狗咬着一隻白色小狗，小狗身上滿是血漬，狀甚恐怖，現場有人疑崩潰跪地，有街坊痛斥大狗狗主無影。另有網上影片所見，有大批警員在場用圍板試圖控制大狗。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-17 下午6.20.22.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026XFVDyG5wNB1786962387.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-17 下午6.20.22.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">據知，今日（17日）下午3時許有一名寵物狗主人報案，表示其愛犬被另一隻大狗咬死。大狗後來被制服，由漁護署帶走，目前案件仍在調查。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-17 下午6.20.57.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/202676iPUaTMVw1786962408.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-17 下午6.20.57.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T11:19:31.284304+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":260,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}